  "query_preview": "..\n(Today through Tuesday)\nIssued at 1200 AM CDT WED JUN 3 2026\n\nSurface and mid-level ridging/high pressure will build across the\narea today, with a similar configuration lasting through Friday.\nThis will promote fair-weather conditions and less-humid air.\n\nOver the weekend, moist onshore flow returns as the surface ridge\npositions. The mid-level ridge is shown to become dampened by\nshortwave troughs on its perimeter. This will allow for shower\nand thunderstorm chances to rebound with a similar pattern\ncontinuing into next week.\n\n89^GSatterwhite",
